---
description: Resolve the actual requested native recovery through model-owned semantic composition.
args:
  goal: string
returns: CliRouteFindings
---
Resolve the actual saved CLI invocation and requested continuation against the authenticated current server and workspace. Choose useful evidence and exact scope inspection through the installed remote-access codebase. Names and visible URLs are not identity or approval. A verified gateway does not itself authorize a particular context or a linked agent mutation; consume the actual scope result. Return the requested route diagnosis and safe continuation based on actual evidence. Do not execute the command merely because a route is available.
